<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>트러블슈팅 on Portfolio</title><link>https://youngyoung-0.github.io/portfolio/tags/%ED%8A%B8%EB%9F%AC%EB%B8%94%EC%8A%88%ED%8C%85/</link><description>Recent content in 트러블슈팅 on Portfolio</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>ko-kr</language><lastBuildDate>Wed, 04 Mar 2026 12:00:00 +0900</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://youngyoung-0.github.io/portfolio/tags/%ED%8A%B8%EB%9F%AC%EB%B8%94%EC%8A%88%ED%8C%85/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Hugo 환경 설정 및 CLI 의존성 트러블슈팅</title><link>https://youngyoung-0.github.io/portfolio/posts/first-troubleshooting/</link><pubDate>Wed, 04 Mar 2026 12:00:00 +0900</pubDate><guid>https://youngyoung-0.github.io/portfolio/posts/first-troubleshooting/</guid><description>&lt;h2 id="report_problem-문제-상황"&gt;&lt;span class="material-symbols-outlined"&gt;report_problem&lt;/span&gt; 문제 상황&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;로컬 환경에서 정적 사이트 빌드를 실행하는 과정에서 CLI 명령어를 찾을 수 없는 에러가 발생했습니다.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;"&gt;&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;Error: command not found: hugo
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h2 id="search-원인-분석"&gt;&lt;span class="material-symbols-outlined"&gt;search&lt;/span&gt; 원인 분석&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;시스템 환경 변수(&lt;code&gt;$PATH&lt;/code&gt;) 상에 Hugo 바이너리가 등록되어 있지 않거나 패키지가 설치되지 않은 상태였습니다.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h2 id="build-해결-방법"&gt;&lt;span class="material-symbols-outlined"&gt;build&lt;/span&gt; 해결 방법&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;macOS 패키지 관리자(Homebrew)를 통해 Hugo 확장 패키지(Extended 버전)를 설치했습니다.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;"&gt;&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;brew install hugo
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;설치 완료 후 바이너리 실행 및 버전을 확인했습니다.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;"&gt;&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;hugo version
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h2 id="insights-주요-학습"&gt;&lt;span class="material-symbols-outlined"&gt;insights&lt;/span&gt; 주요 학습&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;프로젝트 빌드 파이프라인에서 사용하는 CLI 도구의 최소 버전 및 런타임 의존성을 README 및 실행 스크립트에 명시해야 환경 세팅 병목을 방지할 수 있습니다.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>